                                        </h3>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="d-flex align-items-top justify-content-between small">
                                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center">
                                            <i class="bi-mortarboard text-muted me-1"></i>
                                            <span class="text-muted">Centro APECC</span>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="d-flex align-items-center">
                                            <i class="bi-laptop text-muted me-1"></i>
                                            <span class="text-muted">Virtual / En vivo</span>
                                        </div>
